        "text": "The Department of Homeland Security sought to remove Pierre Riley, a Jamaican citizen, from the United States under expedited procedures and issued a final administrative review order (FARO) on January 26, 2021 directing his removal to Jamaica."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5bf1012a4d4cf70aae4a1b1db2d896736fbe82332e7c6b85ca2488dcc43403ef",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5bf1012a4d4c-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Three days after the FARO, Riley fled a petition for review in the Fourth Circuit."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5bf1012a4d4cf70aae4a1b1db2d896736fbe82332e7c6b85ca2488dcc43403ef",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5bf1012a4d4c-0000-0012"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Riley told an immigration officer that a powerful Jamaican drug kingpin had threatened his family and that he would likely be killed if returned to Jamaica."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5bf1012a4d4cf70aae4a1b1db2d896736fbe82332e7c6b85ca2488dcc43403ef",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5bf1012a4d4c-0000-0009"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Supreme Court vacated the lower\u2011court judgment and remanded the case."
      }
    ],
